# A design issue: the defect is not this task's own code. Transient, worktree-local. An
# OPEN entry whose task_id matches is the design_issue verdict. Give a summary precise
# enough to classify the fix from; do not set a fix_kind.
issues:
  - id: "DI-<task-id>"
    task_id: "<id>"
    detected_by: review
    severity: "<low | medium | high>"
    status: open
    summary: "<what is wrong — one or two lines; for a merged-code defect, which behaviour violates which acceptance criterion>"
